{"path":"coroutine/generator/promise_type/unhandled_exception","title":"std::generator<Ref,V,Allocator>::promise_type::unhandled_exception","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">generator&lt;Ref,V,Allocator&gt;::promise_type::</span>unhandled_exception","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/coroutine/generator/promise_type/unhandled_exception","section":"coroutine","kind":"page","summary":"Let x be some generator object.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> unhandled_exception<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Let <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x</span></code> be some <a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/generator\">generator</a> object.\n</p><p>If a <a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/generator#Data_members\">handle</a> referring to the coroutine whose <a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/generator/promise_type\">promise object</a> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is at the top of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/generator#active\">active_</a></i></code></code> of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x</span></code>:\n</p>\n<ul><li> If the handle referring to the coroutine whose promise object is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is the only element of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>x.<span class=\"me1\">active_</span></span></code>, equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">throw</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</li><li> Otherwise, assigns <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/current_exception\">std::current_exception()</a></span> to <code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/generator/promise_type#except\">except_</a></i></code>.\n</li></ul>\n<p>Otherwise, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw.\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"coroutine","title":"Coroutine support (C++20)"},{"path":"coroutine/generator","title":"std::generator"},{"path":"coroutine/generator/promise_type","title":"std::generator<Ref,V,Allocator>::promise_type"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::generator<Ref,V,Allocator>::promise_type::unhandled_exception","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Let x be some generator object."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw."}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":64,"codeBlockCount":0}
